  "notes": [
    "2 independent canonical muzzle effects extracted from existing ChatGPT-generated firing art, each rotated and faded into 8 directional 3-stage sequences; not 48 unique generated illustrations.",
    "All VFX are transparent PNG and completely independent of character imagery.",
    "Effects derived from raster, smoke core clipped at edge of original source; QA required at Android scale.",
    "Muzzle attachment points are hand-inspected approximate from source character art; should be calibrated in Godot before shipping.",
    "No existing combat mechanics or production sprite textures have been changed."
  ]
